# Laravel 13 conventions

- Target **Laravel 13** / PHP ≥ 8.3 only
- Use Form Requests, Policies, Eloquent; prefer Services for Coverage / Zalo / OCR
- Teacher isolation: always authorize ClassProfile / ClassForm via Policy
- Store invite tokens **hashed**; never log Zalo secrets or raw tokens
- Paper images: private disk; validate MIME + size
- Coverage changes must go through `CoverageService` (transactional)
- Do not add `students` / `paper_slips` migrations unless roster backlog is in scope
- Feature tests for vote uniqueness and quota lock when touching those paths
